[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3000.63, "timestamp": "00:50:00", "text": "以上就是演职员表。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3002.87, "timestamp": "00:50:02", "text": "。 而且你其实不需要修读这门课才能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3009.589, "timestamp": "00:50:09", "text": "大多数时候我会跳过像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3011.99, "timestamp": "00:50:11", "text": "贵重物品那个图标，你知道，就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3013.75, "timestamp": "00:50:13", "text": "贵重物品的图标。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3016.309, "timestamp": "00:50:16", "text": "就像……呃，这边的这个东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3018.549, "timestamp": "00:50:18", "text": "这里。 这里。 这基本上就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3021.349, "timestamp": "00:50:21", "text": "他们会拿走的东西，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3025.109, "timestamp": "00:50:25", "text": "提取出来之后就能立刻卖出去。 是的。 就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3026.71, "timestamp": "00:50:26", "text": "这类事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3028.39, "timestamp": "00:50:28", "text": "通常情况下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3029.75, "timestamp": "00:50:29", "text": "，我会跳过这类事情，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3037.19, "timestamp": "00:50:37", "text": "你是想扔东西吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3039.349, "timestamp": "00:50:39", "text": "更简单的方法是将鼠标悬停在内容上，然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3042.71, "timestamp": "00:50:42", "text": "按 F 键，它应该会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3044.39, "timestamp": "00:50:44", "text": "为你显示出来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3046.23, "timestamp": "00:50:46", "text": "哦，你想要这个？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3048.47, "timestamp": "00:50:48", "text": "不，你仍然可以抓取。 不，我没事。 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3048.87, "timestamp": "00:50:48", "text": "有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3050.79, "timestamp": "00:50:50", "text": "高级弹药箱。 那么，我该如何把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3053.67, "timestamp": "00:50:53", "text": "它用在地上呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3055.67, "timestamp": "00:50:55", "text": "呃，点击五。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3056.63, "timestamp": "00:50:56", "text": "哦，五。"